and it is one of a trio with got_ip and got_perk. The client had a got_perk available to set here and set the research one.<br><br>The first int32 is the same id space ResearchUpdate uses. The completion path at 0x10052CFD takes the research table singleton from 0x1002C0D5 and looks the id up through 0x1002BDF5, which calls 0x1002BD8C - and 0x1002BD8C is the lookup ResearchUpdate&#39;s own reader makes at 0x1003A7D8 on its own ids. Two messages, one table. Their signals sit next to each other too: this one emits on GlobalSignals_c + 0x240 and ResearchUpdate on + 0x244.<br><br>Nothing has ever captured one, and that is recorded rather than glossed. PerkUpdate is absent from 646,372 packets - not decoded, and not sitting in the unreadable list either, which is the check that separates a message that cannot be read from one that never arrives. Two logins, a perk purchase and a levelling session produced none. What triggers it is still unknown; what it means is not.'
