t index at 2 and computes [table + index * 16 + 4], which is the same three lists 0x1002C063 writes into, in the same order. Side is 0 Neutral, 1 Clan, 2 Omni, and there are exactly three of them. That is what the three values are: one per side, not one per heading. Four stats never had to divide into three.<br><br>What the value is comes from the slot. 0x1002C063 puts it in the eighth word, + 0x1C of the thirty two byte slot, and 0x1002BE50 tests that same + 0x1C for being negative to decide whether the entry has been filled in yet. PerkUpdate writes experience still owed to + 0x1C of a slot with the same layout, on the character&#39;s own personal map at dynel + 0x1F4, and computes its progress bar against it. Same offset, same field, and the two messages are the global and personal halves of one system - their signals are neighbours as well, GlobalSignals_c + 0x244 here and + 0x240 there.<br><br>The personal branch is worth stating so that nobody looks for it here: bit 6 definitions are not carried by this message at all. It fills the three global side lists and nothing else.'
