        @('var',12,'Six base abilities','player branch','Strength, agility, stamina, intelligence, sense and psychic, as shorts in that order','proven'),
        @('var','2 + length','First name','present when character flag 0x400000','Short length then exactly that many bytes, with no terminator','proven'),
        @('var','2 + length','Last name','present when character flag 0x400000','','proven'),
        @('var',4,'Organisation ID','46 distinct values','Read only when the version byte is above 0x39, at 0x10079396, immediately before the organisation name and behind the same flag. Settled by correspondence rather than by the reader: there are 46 distinct values here and 46 distinct org names, and the two count distributions are the same list element for element - 428, 234, 68, 68, 53, 47, 34, 27, 27, 22, 20, 19 and on down to five singletons. 2349057 appears 428 times and so does &quot;Async Helpers&quot;. A one to one correspondence with the name, on the field directly in front of it, is an organisation id','proven'),
